    lede: `Skill IT publishes two indicative entry-to-mid ranges: roughly ₹3L to ₹9L a year for SOC Analyst roles and roughly ₹3.5L to ₹9L for the Cyber Security programme's Security Analyst and related roles. They overlap almost completely, so there is no published gap to report. The real difference lies in the work, the shifts and the growth path, and that is what should guide your choice.`,
